 keepalive 2.0.0 · help

 a       activity on or off   s esc   stop, back to Home
 + -     15 min more or less  q       stop and quit
 ?       this help            ctrl+c  stop and quit

 Simulate activity moves the pointer a few pixels once you have
 been idle for a while, so Teams and Slack keep showing you as
 Active.
 It pauses while you use the computer or the screen is locked;
 "keepalive doctor" checks that it works here.
 Logs: /home/u/.cache/keepalive/keepalive.log

 ? or esc close
